=============================================================================
TopTronic party mode - reverse-engineered (undocumented HV feature)
=============================================================================
Captures : _party_capture.log  (1st, 2026-08-17 22:34-22:38,
                                sequences 10h@100% / 9h@100% / 8h@100% / 3h@99%)
           _party_capture2.log (2nd, 2026-08-17 22:50-22:52,
                                controlled 1h@100% / 2h@50% / 3h@20%)
Decoder  : see table below (duration in 0.1 h units, power in %)

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
The write protocol (GW -> HV)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Every party-mode action sends TWO consecutive SET requests from the gateway
CAN id 0x1FE04208 (extended, msg_id=0x1F, sender=0x0421 GW, rx=0x47FF HV):

  Frame 1 - DURATION   : 01 46 32 00 07 DA 00 <duration>
  Frame 2 - POWER      : 01 46 32 00 9F 0A <power%>

  command 0x46 = SET_REQUEST
  function_group  = 0x32
  function_number  = 0x00
  Frame 1 datapoint = 0x07DA   value = duration in 0.1 h units
  Frame 2 datapoint = 0x9F0A   value = power in percent

The device echoes both writes back as 0x42 RESPONSE frames on 0x1FD047FF
(cmd 0x42, same datapoint/value), confirming acceptance.

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Decoded sample (from _party_capture2.log)
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Party 1h @ 100% :
  SET  0x1FE04208 : 01 46 32 00 07 DA 00 0A      <- duration 0x0A = 10 x 0.1h = 1h
  SET  0x1FE04208 : 01 46 32 00 9F 0A 64         <- power 0x64 = 100%
  RES  0x1FD047FF : 01 42 32 00 07 DA 00 0A
  RES  0x1FD047FF : 01 42 32 00 9F 0A 64
  (then 0x44 ack frames 44320007da / 44320007e2 from the GW)

Party 2h @ 50% :
  SET  0x1FE04208 : 01 46 32 00 07 DA 00 14      <- 0x14 = 20 x 0.1h = 2h
  SET  0x1FE04208 : 01 46 32 00 9F 0A 32         <- 0x32 = 50%
  RES  0x1FD047FF : 01 42 32 00 07 DA 00 14
  RES  0x1FD047FF : 01 42 32 00 9F 0A 32

Party 3h @ 20% :
  SET  0x1FE04208 : 01 46 32 00 07 DA 00 1E      <- 0x1E = 30 x 0.1h = 3h
  SET  0x1FE04208 : 01 46 32 00 9F 0A 14         <- 0x14 = 20%
  RES  0x1FD047FF : 01 42 32 00 07 DA 00 1E
  RES  0x1FD047FF : 01 42 32 00 9F 0A 14

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Value encoding
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
DURATION (datapoint 0x07DA): hours x 10  (0.1 h per unit, U8)
  desired   raw    hex       desired  raw    hex
  1h        10     0x0A      8h       80     0x50
  2h        20     0x14      9h       90     0x5A
  3h        30     0x1E      10h      100    0x64

POWER (datapoint 0x9F0A): percent, raw byte (U8)
  desired %   raw
  100 %       0x64
  99 %        0x63
  50 %        0x32
  20 %        0x14

Turning "off" (normal week modes) is done with a duration write of 0x00
(01 46 32 00 07 DA 00 00).

